WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.542 --> 00:00:06.503
Koku, we need
your blade and your power.

00:00:07.379 --> 00:00:08.797
You survived?

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.924
Then what about all the others?

00:00:11.008 --> 00:00:14.052
So let's do this together.

00:00:14.136 --> 00:00:15.303
If you don't accept my offer,

00:00:16.013 --> 00:00:17.514
they'll all die.

00:00:17.597 --> 00:00:19.641
Wiped out&nbsp;
like they were never here.

00:00:24.896 --> 00:00:28.316
After all my searching,
I found you, Koku.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.318
No. Killer B.

00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:38.118
Citizens have already begun

00:00:38.201 --> 00:00:39.786
to voice their fears&nbsp;
about the dangers

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.538
of serial murders starting up again.

00:00:41.621 --> 00:00:42.539
Mother of God!

00:00:43.165 --> 00:00:44.833
Lily, go find Keith.

00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:46.001
Yeah, I'm on it.

00:00:51.006 --> 00:00:52.841
So this was a trap.

00:00:54.092 --> 00:00:55.844
Keith has been kidnapped.

00:00:58.597 --> 00:01:00.140
Then it's vengeance.

00:01:10.067 --> 00:01:12.486
Those who kill God
will become devils,

00:01:12.569 --> 00:01:15.113
whereas devil killers
become kings.

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.366
Be careful, everyone!

00:01:33.381 --> 00:01:37.469
There are still a great many things
that you remain ignorant to.

